    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Reducing high blood pressure, preventing diabetes, and decreasing high cholesterol levels can prevent stroke in 80 per cent people prone to the risk. Using the power of biomedical and mobile technologies, researchers at Aga Khan University will develop a simple, glove like device that will empower people to check their blood pressure, sugar and cholesterol, and record an ECG without blood tests anywhere in the world.",
